  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Lift subtitles just above the playback bar when it overlaps them, respecting the configured viewport and bottom offset\n\t\t- Add fullscreen auto-hide for unpinned left and right docked panels, with edge-hover reveal that keeps the video size fixed\n\t\t- Show video thumbnails alongside the seekbar’s hover time and chapter\n\t\t- Reuse resolved playlist item streams and prefer lower-resolution renditions when available\n\t\t- Cache thumbnails and keep the preview decoder open for 60 seconds of inactivity\n\t\t- Add Small, Medium, Large, and Custom percentage sizes that preserve the video’s aspect ratio\n\t\t- Enable seekbar previews for File, UNC, Web, and Live by default\n\t\t- Require a seek window longer than 45 seconds for live HLS thumbnails",
